### Upsert DietaryHabits (create or update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}/dietary-habits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Dieta mediterránea. Consume 3 comidas principales y 2 colaciones. Bebe 2L de agua diaria."
}

###

### Get DietaryHabits for an Evaluation
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}/dietary-habits
